      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "The Al2O3 scale formed on the modified alloy will be adherent and slow-growing.",
      "field": "structural_mediator",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "Al oxidizes preferentially because of its strong affinity for oxygen.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC10820071::webcard"
      ],
      "same_system": "no"
    },
    {
      "text": "A dense Al2O3 scale will act as a barrier to oxygen diffusion into HfNbTaTiZr.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "The proposed Al2O3 scale will mitigate oxidation pesting.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "Limiting oxygen ingress will preserve the bulk microstructure responsible for mechanical performance.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "After 5 hours in air at 800 °C, the Al-modified alloy will have lower oxidation weight gain than untreated equiatomic HfNbTaTiZr.",
      "field": "predicted_outcome",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "After 5 hours in air at 800 °C, the Al-modified alloy will exhibit less oxide-scale spallation than untreated equiatomic HfNbTaTiZr.",
      "field": "predicted_outcome",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "Approximately 1 at.% Al will preserve room-temperature tensile ductility relative to untreated equiatomic HfNbTaTiZr.",
      "field": "predicted_outcome",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "Approximately 1 at.% Al will preserve yield strength at 1000 °C relative to untreated equiatomic HfNbTaTiZr.",
